OL,3,GNEWSAThree jailed for life for murder
OL,4,Aof unarmed father
OL,5,
OL,6,FSobs were heard from the public gallery
OL,7,Fof Southwark Crown Court as Santana and
OL,8,FKones were given minimum term of 23
OL,9,Fyears in prison, while Metumbe was
OL,10,Fjailed for at least 22 years.
